@host = http://localhost:5055

### Successful order (201)
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en-US

{
  "customerId": "customer-1",
  "productId": "keyboard",
  "quantity": 2,
  "paymentToken": "approve",
  "couponCode": "SAVE10"
}

### Out of stock, translated to Dutch (409)
POST {{host}}/orders?culture=nl-NL
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-1",
  "productId": "keyboard",
  "quantity": 8,
  "paymentToken": "approve"
}

### Payment declined, translated to English (400)
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en-US

{
  "customerId": "customer-1",
  "productId": "mouse",
  "quantity": 1,
  "paymentToken": "decline"
}

### Asynchronous customer validation, translated to Dutch (400)
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: nl-NL

{
  "customerId": "unknown-customer",
  "productId": "keyboard",
  "quantity": 2,
  "paymentToken": "approve"
}

### Two asynchronous validation errors in one request (400)
POST {{host}}/orders?culture=en-US
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "unknown-customer",
  "productId": "keyboard",
  "quantity": 2,
  "paymentToken": "approve",
  "couponCode": "NOT-A-COUPON"
}

### Attribute validation, translated to Dutch (400)
POST {{host}}/orders?culture=nl-NL
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "",
  "productId": "keyboard",
  "quantity": 0,
  "paymentToken": "approve"
}

### Product not found (404)
POST {{host}}/orders?culture=nl-NL
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "customer-1",
  "productId": "does-not-exist",
  "quantity": 1,
  "paymentToken": "approve"
}

### Look up a created order: replace the GUID with the returned id
GET {{host}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
